---
---

<section class="section section--deep pricing" id="offre">
  <div class="container">
    <div data-reveal="up">
      <p class="eyebrow">L'offre</p>
      <h2 class="h2" style="margin-top:0.75rem; max-width: 26ch;">Un prix clair. Aucune surprise.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="pricing__grid" data-reveal="scale">
      <div class="pricing__card">
        <p class="pricing__label">Implémentation</p>
        <p class="pricing__amount">[SETUP €]</p>
        <p class="pricing__desc">Configuration complète de votre ChantierPilot : devis, clients, modèles de relance. Payée une seule fois.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="pricing__divider" aria-hidden="true">+</div>

      <div class="pricing__card pricing__card--accent">
        <p class="pricing__label">Abonnement mensuel</p>
        <p class="pricing__amount">[MENSUEL €/mois]</p>
        <p class="pricing__desc">Sans engagement. Résiliable à tout moment, sur simple demande.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="pricing__footnote" data-reveal="up">
      Le prix exact dépend de votre métier et des modules choisis — on le fixe ensemble en démo, avant tout engagement.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .pricing__grid {
    margin-top: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr;
    align-items: center;
    gap: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    max-width: 920px;
  }

  .pricing__card {
    padding: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    border: 1px solid rgba(163, 133, 96, 0.3);
    border-radius: var(--radius-l);
    background: rgba(236, 230, 219, 0.02);
  }

  .pricing__card--accent {
    border-color: var(--or);
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(163, 133, 96, 0.12), rgba(163, 133, 96, 0.02));
  }

  .pricing__label {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(236, 230, 219, 0.6);
  }

  .pricing__amount {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    font-family: var(--f-display);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 4vw, 2.6rem);
    color: var(--or-clair);
  }

  .pricing__desc {
    margin-top: 0.9rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: rgba(236, 230, 219, 0.65);
  }

  .pricing__divider {
    font-family: var(--f-display);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--or);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .pricing__footnote {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: rgba(236, 230, 219, 0.5);
    max-width: 52ch;
  }

  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .pricing__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .pricing__divider {
      display: none;
    }
  }
</style>
